@startuml mongo-model
' Unghosted — MongoDB document model. Database name: unghosted
' Minimal-Mongo decision (2026-09-21): MongoDB holds the tracker only.
' Templates live in packages/shared as static JSON. Everything else is PostgreSQL.

title Unghosted — MongoDB document model (tracker only)

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<collection>> WhiteSmoke
}

class tracker_definitions <<collection>> {
  _id : uuid = project_id
  template_key : string
  template_version : int
  revision : int
  columns : [ { key, type, label, options?,
                computed?, width?, system? } ]
  conditional_rules : [ { key, when, effect } ]
  settings : { template-specific, validated
               against template settings schema }
}

class tracker_rows <<collection>> {
  _id : uuid
  project_id : uuid
  order_key : string (fractional indexing)
  revision : int
  cells : { column_key -> typed value }
  styles : { column_key -> sparse style,
             only cells differing from defaults }
}

tracker_definitions ||--|| tracker_rows : "same project_id, one revision domain"

note bottom of tracker_definitions
  Instantiated from the template JSON at project
  creation, then user-mutated (add column, edit
  options, change settings). $jsonSchema
  validators enforce document shape.
end note

note bottom of tracker_rows
  Indexes:
    (project_id, order_key) — row order + virtualization window
    (project_id, revision) — conflict rebase
  Validation: keys reject leading "$" and any "."
  Cell values validated by schemas built from
  tracker_definitions.columns
  Updates: find_one_and_update with revision filter
  (atomic, guards definition + row edits together)
end note
@enduml
